#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:5
msgid "エントロピー"
msgstr "Entropy"

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:10
msgid "標準エントロピー"
msgstr "Standard Entropy"

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:12
msgid ""
"\\ :ref:`標準状態<standard_state>`\\ にある物質1 molのエントロピー :math:`S_{\\rm m}^o`。 "
"エンタルピーと違ってエントロピーは絶対値が決まり、熱力学第三法則により0 Kの完全結晶のエントロピーを0とおく。 定圧の1 molあたりの熱容量 "
":math:`C_{p,{\\rm m}}^o` を0 Kから積分し、途中の相転移では転移エンタルピー :math:`\\Delta_{\\rm "
"trs}H` を転移温度 :math:`T_{\\rm trs}` で割った量を加えて、"
msgstr ""
"The entropy :math:`S_{\\rm m}^o` of 1 mol of a substance in its \\ "
":ref:`standard state <standard_state>`\\ . Unlike enthalpy, entropy has a"
" definite absolute value: the third law of thermodynamics sets the "
"entropy of a perfect crystal at 0 K to zero. The standard entropy is "
"obtained by integrating the molar heat capacity at constant pressure, "
":math:`C_{p,{\\rm m}}^o`, from 0 K and, at each phase transition along "
"the way, adding the transition enthalpy :math:`\\Delta_{\\rm trs}H` "
"divided by the transition temperature :math:`T_{\\rm trs}`, which gives"

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:17
msgid ""
"S_{\\rm m}^o(T)=\\int_0^T\\frac{C_{p,{\\rm "
"m}}^o(T')}{T'}\\,dT'+\\sum_{\\rm trs}\\frac{\\Delta_{\\rm trs}H}{T_{\\rm "
"trs}}"
msgstr ""
"S_{\\rm m}^o(T)=\\int_0^T\\frac{C_{p,{\\rm "
"m}}^o(T')}{T'}\\,dT'+\\sum_{\\rm trs}\\frac{\\Delta_{\\rm trs}H}{T_{\\rm "
"trs}}"

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:22
msgid "と求める。このため熱力学の表には、標準生成エンタルピーと並んで、標準生成エントロピーではなく標準エントロピーが載る。"
msgstr ""
"This is why thermodynamic tables list the standard entropy, rather than a"
" standard entropy of formation, alongside the standard enthalpy of "
"formation."

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:27
msgid "標準反応エントロピー"
msgstr "Standard Reaction Entropy"

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:29
msgid ""
"反応物と生成物がすべて標準状態にあるとき、反応が反応式どおりに1 mol進む間のエントロピー変化。 :eq:`thermo-standard-"
"reaction-enthalpy`\\ と同じ化学量論係数 :math:`\\nu_i` を使って、"
msgstr ""
"The entropy change when the reaction proceeds by 1 mol as written, with "
"all reactants and products in their standard states. With the same "
"stoichiometric coefficients :math:`\\nu_i` as in Equation :eq:`thermo-"
"standard-reaction-enthalpy`\\ , it is"

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:32
msgid "\\Delta_r S^o=\\sum_i\\nu_i S_{{\\rm m},i}^o"
msgstr "\\Delta_r S^o=\\sum_i\\nu_i S_{{\\rm m},i}^o"

#: ../../thermo/entropy.rst:37
msgid "と、各成分の標準エントロピーから直接求まる。標準エントロピーは絶対値なので、元素の項も0にならない。"
msgstr ""
"which is obtained directly from the standard entropy of each component. "
"Because standard entropies are absolute values, the terms for elements do"
" not vanish either."

